    {
      "id": "composition-smoke-instructions",
      "type": "markdown",
      "label": "Smoke Matrix",
      "root": false,
      "position": {
        "x": -760,
        "y": 390
      },
      "width": 500,
      "height": 410,
      "ports": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "direction": "bidirectional",
          "dataType": "any",
          "angle": 180
        },
        {
          "id": "right",
          "label": "right",
          "direction": "bidirectional",
          "dataType": "view",
          "angle": 0
        }
      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "interface-frame-smoke"
        },
        "markdown": "## Node Composition Smoke Matrix\n\n| Interface | Direction | Behavior |\n|---|---|---|\n| Root | Input socket | Enters through Shared Detail |\n| Action | Input socket | Enters through Action Detail |\n| Create Action | Output plug | Creates a Composition Smoke Node and connects to Action |\n\n### Presentation matrix\n\n- Root uses Shared Detail, Shared Summary, Shared Icon, and Shared Glyph.\n- Action owns Detail and Summary while sharing Icon and Glyph.\n- Create Action is functionality, not a view-bearing interface.\n\n### End-to-end proof target\n\nDrag Create Action into open graph space. The new node must connect through its Action socket and render Action Detail at detail zoom."
      }
    }
